## Configuration

Settings are loaded from `.env` via `pydantic-settings` (see
`src/{{ package_name }}/core/config.py`). `.env` is already git-ignored;
`.env.example` is the checked-in reference of what vars exist — copy it
to `.env` (already done for you here) and adjust as needed.

## Layout

Borrowed from Next.js: routes and worker tasks have one obvious,
consistent home each; shared infrastructure lives in `core/`; the rest
is up to you.

```
src/{{ package_name }}/
  main.py                 Flask entrypoint — create_app(), blueprints, app
{% if worker != "none" %}
  worker.py               {{ worker }} entrypoint — broker/app setup
{% endif %}
  routes/                  one module per resource (Flask Blueprints)
    todos.py                 the Todo list — HTML fragments, not JSON
  templates/                Jinja2 templates, found automatically (default
                             Flask app layout — no extra config needed)
    base.html                 shell: HTMX script tag, stylesheet link
    index.html                 the Todo page
    partials/                  HTMX-swapped fragments (one todo, empty state, ...)
  static/                   served at /static, same default-layout story
{% if css == "tailwind" %}
    css/input.css              Tailwind source (tracked)
    css/style.css              built CSS (git-ignored — see Styling)
{% else %}
    css/style.css              the UI
{% endif %}
  core/                     shared infrastructure
    config.py                settings (pydantic-settings)
{% if database != "none" %}
    db.py                     engine/session setup
{% endif %}
{% if redis %}
    redis.py                  Redis client
{% endif %}
{% if worker != "none" %}
  tasks/                    one module per background job
    example.py                the /tasks/add demo task
{% endif %}
{% if database != "none" %}
  models.py                 {{ orm }} models
{% endif %}
tests/                     tests
{% if migrations and orm == "flask-sqlalchemy" %}
migrations/                 Flask-Migrate migrations
{% elif migrations %}
alembic/                    migrations
{% endif %}
AGENTS.md                  project context for AI coding agents
{% if docker %}
Dockerfile                  container build
{% endif %}
```
